{"_id":"UCOFiUtKui6-x4T-J7_DgCag","communityPosts":[{"postText":"Sorry if some of the recent videos have some spoilers in titles or thumbnails, trying my best to word the videos without them coming across as spoilers. For example the G2 FNC video I worded as History has been made hoping that it was hard to tell what kind of history // the GenG DK video being a bait spoiler etc, will try to be more neutral, value the feedback appreciate it!","postId":"UgkxPkK0Q737ueK5wJzsjKM8b1xKwUAbd7mF","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"//yt3.googleusercontent.com/oZZt8DzfCTAJF6EtkI0exnHPGa9V8SLLrTKfYCw2J2I9RaS2b04fORqNSvNAMDNwvGkavSB-RxQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"//yt3.googleusercontent.com/oZZt8DzfCTAJF6EtkI0exnHPGa9V8SLLrTKfYCw2J2I9RaS2b04fORqNSvNAMDNwvGkavSB-RxQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"//yt3.googleusercontent.com/oZZt8DzfCTAJF6EtkI0exnHPGa9V8SLLrTKfYCw2J2I9RaS2b04fORqNSvNAMDNwvGkavSB-RxQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1724346753216,"voteCount":5400,"postContent":null,"commentCount":216,"authorId":"UCOFiUtKui6-x4T-J7_DgCag","author":"Caedrel","type":"community"},{"postText":"Hey all it&apos;s Caedrel here. Super happy to be Costreaming the LEC every weekend, but I wanted to ask what kind of content you&apos;d like from it ? I&apos;ll do a poll here of the options because 5 videos of every game hurts the algorithm \n\nAppreciate the votes to help, right now we&apos;re doing option 2","postId":"Ugkxf7fUvnDO_1QNDExltrt6Or8fIFZCBWwt","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"//yt3.googleusercontent.com/oZZt8DzfCTAJF6EtkI0exnHPGa9V8SLLrTKfYCw2J2I9RaS2b04fORqNSvNAMDNwvGkavSB-RxQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"//yt3.googleusercontent.com/oZZt8DzfCTAJF6EtkI0exnHPGa9V8SLLrTKfYCw2J2I9RaS2b04fORqNSvNAMDNwvGkavSB-RxQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"//yt3.googleusercontent.com/oZZt8DzfCTAJF6EtkI0exnHPGa9V8SLLrTKfYCw2J2I9RaS2b04fORqNSvNAMDN